plete:source_review34-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"iqu_kre_msh","source_quote":"　　歷仕南中郎行參軍，所給募吏去役，得時病，莫有舍之者，吏扶杖投泌，泌親自隱卹，吏死，泌爲買棺。無僮役，兄弟共輿埋之。領國子助教。乘牽車至染烏頭，見老翁步行，下車載之，躬自步去。","reading":"江泌葬所屬募吏，又下車載老翁，二者皆不具名。","note":"江泌葬所屬募吏，又下車載老翁，二者皆不具名。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:p034","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":89,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-055-filial-complete-ws1545598"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:source_review35-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"iqu_kre_msh","source_quote":"　　世祖以爲南康王子琳侍讀。建武中，明帝害諸王後，泌憂念子琳，詣誌公道人問其禍福。誌公覆香鑪灰示之，曰：「都盡。無所餘。」及子琳被害，泌往哭之，淚盡，繼之以血。親視殯葬，乃去。時廣漢王侍讀嚴桓之亦哭王盡哀。","reading":"江泌哭南康王子琳。嚴桓之所哭為廣漢王，另有侍讀身分。","note":"江泌哭南康王子琳。嚴桓之所哭為廣漢王，另有侍讀身分。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:p035","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":103,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-055-filial-complete-ws1545598"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:source_review36-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"iqu_kre_msh","source_quote":"　　泌尋卒。泌族人兖州治中泌，黃門郎悆子也，與泌同名。世謂泌爲「孝江泌」以別之。","reading":"作兖州治中的同名江泌以黃門郎悆子為別。段首卒及世稱孝江泌均指亮之子。","note":"作兖州治中的同名江泌以黃門郎悆子為別。段首卒及世稱孝江泌均指亮之子。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:p036","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":40,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-055-filial-complete-ws1545598"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:variant_review35-88","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"iqu_kre_msh","source_quote":"時廣漢王侍讀嚴桓之亦哭王盡哀","reading":"嚴桓之的官屬、所哭王與孝江泌一段分錄。","note":"嚴桓之的官屬、所哭王與孝江泌一段分錄。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:p035","start_codepoint":88,"end_codepoint":102,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-055-filial-complete-ws1545598"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-055-filial-complete:variant_review36-9","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"iqu_kre_msh","source_quote"